<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FPIC Insurance as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FPIC Insurance as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer started coverage of FPIC Insurance Group Inc with a buy, an Oppenheimer source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 12-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
